## 02:30, the doc vault

At the user's request I made `doc/` an HMD vault: `doc/.hmd/config.toml`
with `wiki = "."`. Before this, the documents under `doc/` belonged to the
root vault, whose cards start in `knowledge/`, so they were outside every
namespace and the editor's preview had nothing to resolve them in. `hmd
info` now reports 14 pages in the doc vault and `hmd lint` reports no error.

I added one entry to the layout list in `CLAUDE.md` saying so. This is a
shared file; the change is that one entry.

`methodology/` is in the same position as `doc/` was. `CLAUDE.md` says it is
outside every vault on purpose, so I left it and put the question to the
user.
